Milestone 009: Active Enforcement and Dynamic Propagation - COMPLETED

## What was implemented

### 1. Rate Limiting Strategy (Interface & Implementation)
- Created `internal/ratelimit/ratelimit.go` with `RateLimiter` interface and `Decision` struct
- Created `internal/ratelimit/sliding_window.go` with `SlidingWindow` implementation
- Created `internal/ratelimit/ratelimit_test.go` with 5 tests (100% coverage)
- Added `AccountingSettings` to config with `algorithm` and `retry-after-type` fields
- Updated KDL defaults and deployment config with settings block

### 2. Threshold Detection & Immediate Sync
- Added `BlocklistEnforcer` and `BlockBroadcaster` interfaces to accounting engine
- Updated `Engine.Process()` to evaluate rate limit after local increment
- When threshold exceeded: blocks locally via BlocklistEnforcer, broadcasts via BlockBroadcaster
- Updated `EngineConfig.Rules` from slice to map to preserve rule names for metrics
- Updated radix tree to store `accountingRuleWithName` with rule name
- Added `TestEngine_Process_ThresholdBlocking` test

### 3. gRPC Enforcement (Envoy Integration)
- Added `BlocklistChecker` interface to gRPC server
- Updated `Check()` to query blocklist BEFORE accounting
- Returns `PermissionDenied` with HTTP 429 and `Retry-After` header when blocked
- Short-circuits: skips accounting if blocked
- Tracks response codes with `IncGRPCResponseCode` metric
- Added `TestCheck_BlockedEntity` and `TestCheck_NotBlockedEntity` tests

### 4. Observability & Metrics
- Added `drl_ratelimit_blocks_total` counter (labels: rule_name, reason)
- Added `drl_ratelimit_propagation_latency_ms` histogram
- Added `drl_grpc_response_code_total` counter (labels: code)
- Added helper methods and updated metrics tests

### 5. Wiring
- Updated `cmd/accounting.go` to pass blocklist and broadcaster to engine
- Updated `cmd/envoy.go` to pass blocklist to gRPC server
- Updated `cmd/root.go` with new parameter passing

## Test Results
- All 264 tests pass across 9 packages
- 0 lint issues
- Coverage: accounting 87.8%, grpc 92.0%, ratelimit 100%, metrics 97.8%
